  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AQABA THERMAL POWER STATION EXTENSION AND 400 KV S/S PROJ</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE MAIN PURPOSE OF THIS PROJECT IS TO SATISFY THE GROWING DEMAND FOR ELECTRICAL ENERGY IN THE NATIONAL GRID OF JORDAN. IT AIMS AT THE INSTALLATION OF 400 KV SUBSTATION AT AQABA AND AMMAN AND ALSO CONSTRUCTION OF 2*130 MW STEAM TURBINE GENERATORS.</narrative>
  </description>
